2026-10-31 18:56:55,562 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5e29017d-ffb9-432d-bdbe-a5bc2420e390', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-31 18:56:55（周六）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。按照用户提问为准该时间只是校准用，不作为业务时间（除用户提出今天或者等等意图时才可以带入）。\n\n【主技能画像】\n- 技能ID: 36\n- 技能名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率\n- 技能描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【主技能规则口径】\n1，产品的成本以erp_material表为准\n2，需要计算材料成本时以BOM表为准\n3，根据提问需要区分内容是产品名称还是sku\n\n【本次执行单元清单】\n- 技能ID: 36, 名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率, 描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【技能组全局设定】\n技能组：nova系统\nerp+crm客户与销售产线系统合并技能\n\n你是负责最终业务总结的助手。请对本次技能的执行结果做业务解读与总结。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：海纳动力现在要采购一批六轴工业机器人六轴-253数量：10\n激光测距仪激光-598数量：10\n位移传感器位移-369数量：10，你帮我算一下需要开合同销售价格多少钱，我们的产品成本是多少、库存是否足够\n\n【技能各执行单元的过程与结果】\n## 执行单元【分析客户合同销售毛利率】结果\n\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：查询海纳动力客户信息及六轴工业机器人、激光测距仪、位移传感器对应的ERP商品ID、标准售价及当前可用库存\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    # 1. Query Customer Info for "海纳动力"\n    sql_customer = """\n        SELECT id, customer_code, customer_name \n        FROM nova_crm.crm_customer \n        WHERE customer_name LIKE %s AND is_deleted = 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_customer, (\'%海纳动力%\',))\n    customers = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    if not customers:\n        print("No customer found matching \'海纳动力\'")\n        handoff_data = {}\n    else:\n        # Take the first match as the primary customer\n        target_customer = customers[0]\n        customer_id = target_customer[0]\n        customer_code = target_customer[1]\n        customer_name = target_customer[2]\n        \n        # 2. Query Product Info and Inventory for the specified items\n        # Items: 六轴工业机器人 (SKU: 六轴-253), 激光测距仪 (SKU: 激光-598), 位移传感器 (SKU: 位移-369)\n        product_queries = [\n            {\'name\': \'六轴工业机器人\', \'code_hint\': \'六轴-253\'},\n            {\'name\': \'激光测距仪\', \'code_hint\': \'激光-598\'},\n            {\'name\': \'位移传感器\', \'code_hint\': \'位移-369\'}\n        ]\n        \n        results = []\n        \n        for item in product_queries:\n            hint = item[\'code_hint\']\n            # Search in erp_product for code or name matching the hint\n            sql_product = """\n                SELECT id, product_code, product_name, sale_price, unit\n                FROM nova_erp.erp_product\n                WHERE (product_code LIKE %s OR product_name LIKE %s OR spec LIKE %s) AND is_deleted = 0\n                LIMIT 1\n            """\n            pattern = f\'%{hint}%\'\n            cursor.execute(sql_product, (pattern, pattern, pattern))\n            prod = cursor.fetchone()\n            \n            if prod:\n                product_id = prod[0]\n                product_code = prod[1]\n                product_name = prod[2]\n                sale_price = float(prod[3]) if prod[3] is not None else 0.0\n                unit = prod[4]\n                \n                # Get Material ID linked to this Product to check inventory\n                # erp_material.product_id -> erp_product.id\n                sql_material_inv = """\n                    SELECT m.id as material_id, m.material_name, SUM(i.available_qty) as total_available_qty\n                    FROM nova_erp.erp_material m\n                    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_inventory i ON m.id = i.material_id\n                    WHERE m.product_id = %s AND m.is_deleted = 0\n                    GROUP BY m.id, m.material_name\n                """\n                cursor.execute(sql_material_inv, (product_id,))\n                inv_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n                \n                available_qty = 0\n                material_info = ""\n                if inv_rows:\n                    for row in inv_rows:\n                        qty = row[2]\n                        if qty is not None:\n                            available_qty += float(qty)\n                        material_info += f"{row[1]}({row[0]}): {float(qty) if qty else 0}, "\n                \n                results.append({\n                    \'product_id\': product_id,\n                    \'product_code\': product_code,\n                    \'product_name\': product_name,\n                    \'unit\': unit,\n                    \'standard_sale_price\': sale_price,\n                    \'available_stock\': available_qty,\n                    \'requested_qty\': 10,\n                    \'stock_sufficient\': available_qty >= 10\n                })\n            else:\n                results.append({\n                    \'product_id\': None,\n                    \'product_code\': hint,\n                    \'product_name\': item[\'name\'],\n                    \'unit\': \'\',\n                    \'standard_sale_price\': 0.0,\n                    \'available_stock\': 0,\n                    \'requested_qty\': 10,\n                    \'stock_sufficient\': False,\n                    \'error\': \'Product not found\'\n                })\n\n        # Print Results Table\n        print(f"Customer: {customer_name} ({customer_code})")\n        print("-" * 100)\n        header = f"{\'Product Name\':<20} | {\'Code\':<15} | {\'Std Price\':>10} | {\'Req Qty\':>8} | {\'Avail Stock\':>12} | {\'Sufficient?\':>10}"\n        print(header)\n        print("-" * 100)\n        \n        total_contract_value = 0\n        \n        for r in results:\n            p_name = r[\'product_name\'][:18] + ".." if len(r[\'product_name\']) > 20 else r[\'product_name\']\n            p_code = r[\'product_code\']\n            price = r[\'standard_sale_price\']\n            req = r[\'requested_qty\']\n            avail = r[\'available_stock\']\n            suff = "Yes" if r[\'stock_sufficient\'] else "No"\n            \n            line_val = price * req\n            total_contract_value += line_val\n            \n            print(f"{p_name:<20} | {p_code:<15} | {price:>10.2f} | {req:>8} | {avail:>12.2f} | {suff:>10}")\n            \n        print("-" * 100)\n        print(f"Total Estimated Contract Value (Standard Prices): {total_contract_value:.2f}")\n        \n        # Prepare Handoff Data\n        valid_products = [r for r in results if r[\'product_id\'] is not None]\n        handoff_data = {\n            \'customer_id\': int(customer_id),\n            \'customer_code\': str(customer_code),\n            \'products\': [\n                {\n                    \'product_id\': int(r[\'product_id\']),\n                    \'product_code\': str(r[\'product_code\']),\n                    \'quantity\': int(r[\'requested_qty\']),\n                    \'standard_price\': float(r[\'standard_sale_price\'])\n                } for r in valid_products\n            ]\n        }\n\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nCustomer: 海纳动力系统股份有限公司 (CUS0006)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProduct Name         | Code            |  Std Price |  Req Qty |  Avail Stock | Sufficient?\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n六轴工业机器人 六轴-253       | SKU0001         |  359292.00 |       10 |        23.08 |        Yes\n激光测距仪 激光-598         | SKU0002         |   47170.00 |       10 |        17.00 |        Yes\n位移传感器 位移-369         | SKU0003         |    2413.00 |       10 |         6.00 |         No\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTotal Estimated Contract Value (Standard Prices): 4088750.00\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：根据商品ID关联物料主数据获取物料ID，结合BOM表计算各产品的单位材料成本并汇总总成本\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("数据库连接不可用")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_adfa379ad7\n    products = handoff_data.get(\'products\', [])\n    \n    if not products:\n        print("未找到产品信息，无法计算成本")\n    else:\n        product_ids = [p[\'product_id\'] for p in products]\n        \n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(product_ids))\n        \n        sql_material = f"""\n            SELECT \n                m.id as material_id,\n                m.material_code,\n                m.material_name,\n                m.product_id,\n                m.standard_cost,\n                m.source_type\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_material m\n            WHERE m.product_id IN ({placeholders})\n              AND m.is_deleted = 0\n              AND m.status = 1\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_material, tuple(product_ids))\n        materials = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        if not materials:\n            print("未找到对应的物料主数据")\n        else:\n            mat_df = pd.DataFrame(materials, columns=[\'material_id\', \'material_code\', \'material_name\', \'product_id\', \'standard_cost\', \'source_type\'])\n            \n            material_ids = mat_df[\'material_id\'].tolist()\n            mat_placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(material_ids))\n            \n            sql_bom_items = f"""\n                SELECT \n                    bi.component_material_id,\n                    bi.qty_per,\n                    bi.loss_rate,\n                    cm.standard_cost as component_standard_cost,\n                    cm.material_name as component_material_name,\n                    bom.material_id as parent_material_id\n                FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item bi\n                JOIN nova_erp.erp_bom bom ON bi.bom_id = bom.id\n                JOIN nova_erp.erp_material cm ON bi.component_material_id = cm.id\n                WHERE bom.material_id IN ({mat_placeholders})\n                  AND bom.status = 2\n                  AND bom.is_deleted = 0\n                  AND cm.is_deleted = 0\n            """\n            cursor.execute(sql_bom_items, tuple(material_ids))\n            bom_items = cursor.fetchall()\n            \n            if not bom_items:\n                print("未找到BOM明细数据，使用物料标准成本作为单位成本")\n                mat_df[\'unit_material_cost\'] = mat_df[\'standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n            else:\n                bom_df = pd.DataFrame(bom_items, columns=[\'component_material_id\', \'qty_per\', \'loss_rate\', \'component_standard_cost\', \'component_material_name\', \'parent_material_id\'])\n                \n                bom_df[\'qty_per\'] = bom_df[\'qty_per\'].astype(float)\n                bom_df[\'loss_rate\'] = bom_df[\'loss_rate\'].astype(float)\n                bom_df[\'component_standard_cost\'] = bom_df[\'component_standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n                \n                bom_df[\'effective_qty\'] = bom_df[\'qty_per\'] * (1 + bom_df[\'loss_rate\'] / 100)\n                bom_df[\'line_cost\'] = bom_df[\'effective_qty\'] * bom_df[\'component_standard_cost\']\n                \n                cost_summary = bom_df.groupby(\'parent_material_id\')[\'line_cost\'].sum().reset_index()\n                cost_summary.columns = [\'material_id\', \'bom_calculated_cost\']\n                \n                mat_df = mat_df.merge(cost_summary, on=\'material_id\', how=\'left\')\n                \n                mat_df[\'unit_material_cost\'] = mat_df.apply(\n                    lambda row: float(row[\'bom_calculated_cost\']) if pd.notna(row[\'bom_calculated_cost\']) and row[\'bom_calculated_cost\'] > 0 else float(row[\'standard_cost\']),\n                    axis=1\n                )\n            \n            prod_map = {p[\'product_id\']: p for p in products}\n            \n            result_rows = []\n            for _, row in mat_df.iterrows():\n                pid = int(row[\'product_id\'])\n                if pid in prod_map:\n                    qty = prod_map[pid][\'quantity\']\n                    unit_cost = float(row[\'unit_material_cost\'])\n                    total_cost = unit_cost * qty\n                    result_rows.append({\n                        \'product_code\': prod_map[pid].get(\'product_code\', \'\'),\n                        \'product_id\': pid,\n                        \'material_code\': row[\'material_code\'],\n                        \'material_name\': row[\'material_name\'],\n                        \'quantity\': qty,\n                        \'unit_material_cost\': round(unit_cost, 4),\n                        \'total_material_cost\': round(total_cost, 2)\n                    })\n            \n            res_df = pd.DataFrame(result_rows)\n            \n            if not res_df.empty:\n                res_df[\'unit_material_cost\'] = res_df[\'unit_material_cost\'].astype(float)\n                res_df[\'total_material_cost\'] = res_df[\'total_material_cost\'].astype(float)\n                \n                total_all_cost = res_df[\'total_material_cost\'].sum()\n                \n                print("=" * 80)\n                print("产品材料成本分析结果")\n                print("=" * 80)\n                print(res_df.to_string(index=False))\n                print("-" * 80)\n                print(f"所有产品总材料成本: {round(total_all_cost, 2)} 元")\n                print("=" * 80)\n            else:\n                print("未能匹配到有效的产品与物料关系")\n                \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"执行出错: {str(e)}")\nfinally:\n    try:\n        cursor.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.rollback()\n    except:\n        pass\n    try:\n        conn.close()\n    except:\n        pass\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n执行出错: (1054, "Unknown column \'bom.is_deleted\' in \'where clause\'")\n```\n\n\n请遵循系统设定的主技能规则口径，依据上述执行结果，用通俗易懂的语言给业务用户一份最终 Markdown 总结：\n1. 屏蔽所有技术细节（SQL、表名、代码、字段名一律不出现）；\n2. 若包含多个执行单元，先分单元给出核心结论，再进行整体综合分析与建议；\n3. 若某单元无有效结果或执行失败，如实简要说明，不要编造数据；\n4. 【数据一律表格化】凡是指标、数值、排行、对比、分类汇总、明细清单这类数据，一律用 Markdown 表格呈现，不要写成大段文字或纯项目符号；表格必须有表头，数值列标注单位与统计口径（时间范围、分组维度、币种等），小数位与执行结果精度保持一致，空值/缺失值明确写“无数据”，不得留空或擅自补 0；\n5. 【分析类必须给出数据依据】先给核心指标的数值与对比基准（同比/环比/占比/目标值），再说明样本量与覆盖范围（时间跨度、记录条数、覆盖客户/合同/产品数量），对异常值、极值、缺失项单独说明可能原因；既不能只给结论不给数据，也不能只堆明细不做归纳；\n6. 明细较多时，先给按关键维度聚合的汇总表，再补 Top N 或代表性明细，并注明筛选、排序与聚合口径，避免把原始明细逐行罗列；\n7. 篇幅不设上限：执行结果里的数据、结论、异常项、原因分析和建议都要完整写出，不得为了控制长度而压缩、省略、只列要点或写“详见上文”；宁可写得长也不遗漏关键信息。\n以上关于完整性与数据呈现的要求优先于其他任何“简洁/精简/控制字数”的设定。'}], 'model': 'qwen3.8-flash', 'stream': True, 'temperature': 0.7}, 'extra_json': {'enable_thinking': False}}
