2026-10-31 19:07:28,470 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-10364cd2-cb87-47f6-99d4-b19aa5a9d5ac', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-31 19:07:28（周六）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。按照用户提问为准该时间只是校准用，不作为业务时间（除用户提出今天或者等等意图时才可以带入）。\n\n【主技能画像】\n- 技能ID: 36\n- 技能名称: 合同、成本、及生产分析\n- 技能描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能、以及bom材料成本计算，物料齐套性分析，物料分析，库存分析\n\n【主技能规则口径】\n1，产品的成本以erp_material表为准\n2，需要计算材料成本时以BOM表为准\n3，根据提问需要区分内容是产品名称还是sku\n\n【本次执行单元清单】\n- 技能ID: 36, 名称: 合同、成本、及生产分析, 描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能、以及bom材料成本计算，物料齐套性分析，物料分析，库存分析\n\n【技能组全局设定】\n技能组：nova系统\nerp+crm客户与销售产线系统合并技能，生产管理、销售管理、订单管理、客户管理\n\n你是负责最终业务总结的助手。请对本次技能的执行结果做业务解读与总结。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：我要生产六轴工业机器人六轴-253生产10台，帮我看下所需的材料是否够，如果不够告诉我需要采购多少数量\n\n【技能各执行单元的过程与结果】\n## 执行单元【合同、成本、及生产分析】结果\n\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：根据产品名称\'六轴工业机器人六轴-253\'在nova_erp.erp_material表中查找对应的物料ID（需关联nova_erp.erp_product表确认SKU与物料的映射关系，或直接通过物料名称模糊匹配找到类型为成品的物料）\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    sql = """\n        SELECT \n            m.id AS material_id,\n            m.material_code,\n            m.material_name,\n            m.material_type,\n            m.product_id,\n            p.product_code,\n            p.product_name\n        FROM nova_erp.erp_material m\n        LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_product p ON m.product_id = p.id\n        WHERE (m.material_name LIKE %s OR p.product_name LIKE %s)\n          AND m.is_deleted = 0\n          AND (m.status = 1 OR m.status IS NULL)\n    """\n    keyword = \'%六轴工业机器人六轴-253%\'\n    cursor.execute(sql, (keyword, keyword))\n    \n    results = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    if not results:\n        print("未找到名称包含\'六轴工业机器人六轴-253\'的物料或产品，尝试仅匹配\'六轴-253\'...")\n        keyword_alt = \'%六轴-253%\'\n        cursor.execute(sql, (keyword_alt, keyword_alt))\n        results = cursor.fetchall()\n\n    if results:\n        print(f"{\'Material ID\':<15} {\'Code\':<15} {\'Name\':<30} {\'Type\':<10} {\'Product Code\':<15} {\'Product Name\':<30}")\n        print("-" * 115)\n        \n        target_material_ids = []\n        for row in results:\n            mat_id, mat_code, mat_name, mat_type, prod_id, prod_code, prod_name = row\n            type_desc = {1: \'原材料\', 2: \'半成品\', 3: \'成品\', 4: \'辅料包材\'}.get(mat_type, str(mat_type))\n            print(f"{mat_id:<15} {mat_code:<15} {mat_name:<30} {type_desc:<10} {prod_code or \'NULL\':<15} {prod_name or \'NULL\':<30}")\n            \n            if mat_type == 3:\n                target_material_ids.append(mat_id)\n        \n        if target_material_ids:\n            print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'target_material_ids\': target_material_ids}))\n        else:\n            print("警告：找到的记录中没有类型为\'成品\'(material_type=3)的物料，后续步骤可能需要人工确认。")\n            print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'target_material_ids\': []}))\n    else:\n        print("数据库中未查询到相关物料信息。")\n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'target_material_ids\': []}))\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nMaterial ID     Code            Name                           Type       Product Code    Product Name                  \n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1               FG0001          六轴工业机器人六轴-253                  成品         SKU0001         六轴工业机器人 六轴-253                \n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：基于步骤1获取的父件物料ID，查询nova_erp.erp_bom表中状态为\'已发布\'的最新有效BOM头信息，获取bom_id和base_qty\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_658e47729e\n    target_material_ids = handoff_data.get(\'target_material_ids\', [])\n    \n    if not target_material_ids:\n        print("No target material IDs found in handoff data.")\n        result_df = pd.DataFrame()\n    else:\n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(target_material_ids))\n        sql = f"""\n            SELECT \n                id, \n                bom_no, \n                material_id, \n                bom_version, \n                base_qty, \n                base_unit, \n                yield_rate, \n                status, \n                effective_date, \n                expire_date\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_bom\n            WHERE material_id IN ({placeholders})\n              AND status = 2\n            ORDER BY effective_date DESC, created_at DESC;\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql, tuple(target_material_ids))\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        import pandas as pd\n        result_df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n        \n        if not result_df.empty:\n            # Ensure numeric types are handled correctly if needed later, though we just pass IDs here\n            # We need to identify the latest BOM for each material_id to pass down\n            # Assuming one latest valid BOM per material based on ordering\n            latest_boms = result_df.groupby(\'material_id\').first().reset_index()\n            \n            bom_ids = latest_boms[\'id\'].tolist()\n            base_qtys = dict(zip(latest_boms[\'id\'], latest_boms[\'base_qty\']))\n            \n            print(f"Found {len(bom_ids)} published BOMs for the requested materials.")\n            print(result_df.to_string(index=False))\n            \n            handoff_out = {\n                \'bom_ids\': bom_ids,\n                \'bom_base_qty_map\': {str(k): float(v) for k, v in base_qtys.items()}\n            }\n            print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_out))\n        else:\n            print("No published BOMs found for the specified materials.")\n            print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'bom_ids\': [], \'bom_base_qty_map\': {}}))\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nFound 1 published BOMs for the requested materials.\n id      bom_no  material_id bom_version base_qty base_unit yield_rate  status effective_date expire_date\n 13 BOMFG0001V1            1          V1     1.00         套      98.00       2     2023-10-07        None\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 步骤3：根据步骤2获取的bom_id，查询nova_erp.erp_bom_item表获取所有子件物料ID、单位用量(qty_per)及损耗率(loss_rate)\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nconn = None\ntry:\n    conn = get_connection()\n    if conn is None:\n        raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n    \n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_658e47729e\n    bom_ids = handoff_data.get(\'bom_ids\', [])\n    \n    if not bom_ids:\n        print("No BOM IDs found in handoff data.")\n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'bom_items\': []}))\n    else:\n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(bom_ids))\n        sql = f"""\n            SELECT \n                id,\n                bom_id,\n                line_no,\n                component_material_id,\n                qty_per,\n                loss_rate,\n                unit,\n                is_key_component,\n                substitute_group\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item\n            WHERE bom_id IN ({placeholders})\n            ORDER BY bom_id, line_no\n        """\n        \n        cursor.execute(sql, tuple(bom_ids))\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n        \n        result_list = []\n        for row in rows:\n            item_dict = {}\n            for col_name, value in zip(columns, row):\n                if hasattr(value, \'item\'):\n                    try:\n                        val = float(value)\n                    except:\n                        val = str(value)\n                elif isinstance(value, (int, float, str, type(None))):\n                    val = value\n                else:\n                    val = str(value)\n                item_dict[col_name] = val\n            result_list.append(item_dict)\n            \n        print(f"Found {len(result_list)} BOM items.")\n        if result_list:\n             print(json.dumps(result_list[:5], ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n        \n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'bom_items\': result_list}))\n\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error: {e}")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\nfinally:\n    if conn:\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nFound 8 BOM items.\n[\n  {\n    "id": 53,\n    "bom_id": 13,\n    "line_no": 1,\n    "component_material_id": 30,\n    "qty_per": "1.0000",\n    "loss_rate": "0.00",\n    "unit": "套",\n    "is_key_component": 1,\n    "substitute_group": null\n  },\n  {\n    "id": 54,\n    "bom_id": 13,\n    "line_no": 2,\n    "component_material_id": 31,\n    "qty_per": "1.0000",\n    "loss_rate": "0.00",\n    "unit": "套",\n    "is_key_component": 1,\n    "substitute_group": null\n  },\n  {\n    "id": 55,\n    "bom_id": 13,\n    "line_no": 3,\n    "component_material_id": 32,\n    "qty_per": "1.0000",\n    "loss_rate": "0.00",\n    "unit": "套",\n    "is_key_component": 1,\n    "substitute_group": null\n  },\n  {\n    "id": 56,\n    "bom_id": 13,\n    "line_no": 4,\n    "component_material_id": 34,\n    "qty_per": "1.0000",\n    "loss_rate": "2.00",\n    "unit": "套",\n    "is_key_component": 0,\n    "substitute_group": null\n  },\n  {\n    "id": 57,\n    "bom_id": 13,\n    "line_no": 5,\n    "component_material_id": 35,\n    "qty_per": "1.0000",\n    "loss_rate": "0.00",\n    "unit": "套",\n    "is_key_component": 0,\n    "substitute_group": null\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### 步骤 4: 步骤4：结合生产数量10台和BOM基础数量，计算各子件的总需求量（公式：总需求 = 10 * qty_per * (1 + loss_rate/100) / base_qty），并关联nova_erp.erp_inventory表获取各子件当前的可用库存(available_qty)和在途数量(in_transit_qty)\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_658e47729e\n    bom_items = handoff_data.get(\'bom_items\', [])\n    bom_base_qty_map = handoff_data.get(\'bom_base_qty_map\', {})\n    \n    if not bom_items:\n        print("No BOM items found in handoff data.")\n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'material_requirements\': []}))\n    else:\n        production_qty = 10\n        \n        component_material_ids = list(set([item[\'component_material_id\'] for item in bom_items]))\n        \n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(component_material_ids))\n        sql_inventory = f"""\n            SELECT \n                material_id,\n                available_qty,\n                in_transit_qty\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_inventory\n            WHERE material_id IN ({placeholders})\n        """\n        \n        cursor.execute(sql_inventory, component_material_ids)\n        inventory_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        inventory_map = {}\n        for row in inventory_rows:\n            mid = row[0]\n            avail = float(row[1]) if row[1] is not None else 0.0\n            transit = float(row[2]) if row[2] is not None else 0.0\n            inventory_map[mid] = {\n                \'available_qty\': avail,\n                \'in_transit_qty\': transit\n            }\n        \n        requirements_list = []\n        \n        for item in bom_items:\n            comp_mid = item[\'component_material_id\']\n            qty_per = float(item[\'qty_per\'])\n            loss_rate = float(item[\'loss_rate\'])\n            bom_id = item[\'bom_id\']\n            \n            base_qty = float(bom_base_qty_map.get(str(bom_id), 1.0))\n            if base_qty == 0:\n                base_qty = 1.0\n            \n            total_demand = production_qty * qty_per * (1 + loss_rate / 100) / base_qty\n            \n            inv_info = inventory_map.get(comp_mid, {\'available_qty\': 0.0, \'in_transit_qty\': 0.0})\n            current_available = inv_info[\'available_qty\']\n            current_in_transit = inv_info[\'in_transit_qty\']\n            \n            total_stock = current_available + current_in_transit\n            \n            shortage = max(0, total_demand - total_stock)\n            \n            requirements_list.append({\n                \'component_material_id\': comp_mid,\n                \'total_demand\': round(total_demand, 4),\n                \'available_qty\': round(current_available, 4),\n                \'in_transit_qty\': round(current_in_transit, 4),\n                \'shortage\': round(shortage, 4)\n            })\n        \n        print(f"{\'Material ID\':<15} | {\'Total Demand\':<15} | {\'Available Qty\':<15} | {\'In Transit Qty\':<15} | {\'Shortage\':<15}")\n        print("-" * 85)\n        for req in requirements_list:\n            print(f"{req[\'component_material_id\']:<15} | {req[\'total_demand\']:<15} | {req[\'available_qty\']:<15} | {req[\'in_transit_qty\']:<15} | {req[\'shortage\']:<15}")\n        \n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'material_requirements\': requirements_list}))\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nMaterial ID     | Total Demand    | Available Qty   | In Transit Qty  | Shortage       \n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n30              | 10.0            | 24.0            | 0.0             | 0              \n31              | 10.0            | 22.0            | 0.0             | 0              \n32              | 10.0            | 9.0             | 0.0             | 1.0            \n34              | 10.2            | 9.0             | 0.0             | 1.2            \n35              | 10.0            | 30.0            | 39.0            | 0              \n40              | 20.6            | 23.0            | 0.0             | 0              \n65              | 84.0            | 1258.0          | 0.0             | 0              \n46              | 127.2           | 1347.0          | 0.0             | 0              \n```\n\n### 步骤 5: 步骤5：对比总需求量与（可用库存+在途数量），计算缺口数量。若缺口大于0，则输出需要采购的数量；若缺口小于等于0，则告知材料充足\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_658e47729e\nmaterial_requirements = handoff.get(\'material_requirements\', [])\n\nif not material_requirements:\n    print("未找到物料需求数据，无法进行齐套性分析。")\nelse:\n    shortage_list = []\n    sufficient_list = []\n    \n    for item in material_requirements:\n        comp_id = item[\'component_material_id\']\n        demand = float(item[\'total_demand\'])\n        available = float(item[\'available_qty\'])\n        in_transit = float(item[\'in_transit_qty\'])\n        \n        total_supply = available + in_transit\n        gap = demand - total_supply\n        \n        if gap > 0:\n            shortage_list.append({\n                \'material_id\': comp_id,\n                \'demand\': round(demand, 4),\n                \'available\': round(available, 4),\n                \'in_transit\': round(in_transit, 4),\n                \'shortage\': round(gap, 4)\n            })\n        else:\n            sufficient_list.append({\n                \'material_id\': comp_id,\n                \'demand\': round(demand, 4),\n                \'available\': round(available, 4),\n                \'in_transit\': round(in_transit, 4),\n                \'surplus\': round(-gap, 4)\n            })\n            \n    print(f"=== 六轴工业机器人六轴-253 生产10台 物料齐套性分析结果 ===\\n")\n    \n    if shortage_list:\n        print("【缺料明细】以下材料库存不足，需要采购：")\n        header = f"{\'物料ID\':<10} | {\'总需求量\':<12} | {\'可用库存\':<12} | {\'在途数量\':<12} | {\'需采购数量\':<12}"\n        print(header)\n        print("-" * len(header))\n        for s in shortage_list:\n            print(f"{s[\'material_id\']:<10} | {s[\'demand\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'available\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'in_transit\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'shortage\']:<12.4f}")\n        print("\\n提示：需采购数量 = 总需求量 - (可用库存 + 在途数量)")\n    else:\n        print("【结论】所有所需材料库存充足（含在途），无需额外采购。")\n        \n    if sufficient_list:\n        print("\\n【库存充足材料】")\n        header_s = f"{\'物料ID\':<10} | {\'总需求量\':<12} | {\'可用库存\':<12} | {\'在途数量\':<12} | {\'剩余量\':<12}"\n        print(header_s)\n        print("-" * len(header_s))\n        for s in sufficient_list:\n            print(f"{s[\'material_id\']:<10} | {s[\'demand\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'available\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'in_transit\']:<12.4f} | {s[\'surplus\']:<12.4f}")\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n=== 六轴工业机器人六轴-253 生产10台 物料齐套性分析结果 ===\n\n【缺料明细】以下材料库存不足，需要采购：\n物料ID       | 总需求量         | 可用库存         | 在途数量         | 需采购数量       \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n32         | 10.0000      | 9.0000       | 0.0000       | 1.0000      \n34         | 10.2000      | 9.0000       | 0.0000       | 1.2000      \n\n提示：需采购数量 = 总需求量 - (可用库存 + 在途数量)\n\n【库存充足材料】\n物料ID       | 总需求量         | 可用库存         | 在途数量         | 剩余量         \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n30         | 10.0000      | 24.0000      | 0.0000       | 14.0000     \n31         | 10.0000      | 22.0000      | 0.0000       | 12.0000     \n35         | 10.0000      | 30.0000      | 39.0000      | 59.0000     \n40         | 20.6000      | 23.0000      | 0.0000       | 2.4000      \n65         | 84.0000      | 1258.0000    | 0.0000       | 1174.0000   \n46         | 127.2000     | 1347.0000    | 0.0000       | 1219.8000\n```\n\n\n请遵循系统设定的主技能规则口径，依据上述执行结果，用通俗易懂的语言给业务用户一份最终 Markdown 总结：\n1. 屏蔽所有技术细节（SQL、表名、代码、字段名一律不出现）；\n2. 若包含多个执行单元，先分单元给出核心结论，再进行整体综合分析与建议；\n3. 若某单元无有效结果或执行失败，如实简要说明，不要编造数据；\n4. 【数据一律表格化】凡是指标、数值、排行、对比、分类汇总、明细清单这类数据，一律用 Markdown 表格呈现，不要写成大段文字或纯项目符号；表格必须有表头，数值列标注单位与统